# The image holds what runs and nothing else, so everything is left out and the few
# files the build needs are let back in. No tests, .venv, .git, .claude, .vscode or
# out/; and no scripts/ or sql/: seeding is done from a checkout, with uv.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!src/
